ength to love. A feminist librarian, single by conviction, who’s decided that she won’t be a mother. A six-year-old child trying to find a place in a new family structure. By revealing their aspirations, their fears, their choices, Carine Tardieu depicts different ways in which humans create families."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Sandra, quinquagénaire farouchement indépendante, partage soudainement et malgré elle l’intimité de son voisin de palier et de ses deux enfants. Contre toute attente, elle s’attache peu à peu à cette famille d’adoption.","tagline":"L'amour n'a pas de liens, il a des racines."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x5yrKvkEK5lU5Kn7HpU3sxPwqiB.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7UABiSiMvOKXU6kxNrStIUo2IVM.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1096642,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x5yrKvkEK5lU5Kn7HpU3sxPwqiB.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/x5yrKvkEK5lU5Kn7HpU3sxPwqiB.jpg","language":"it","width":1143,"height":1714},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x5yrKvkEK5lU5Kn7HpU3sxPwqiB.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/x5yrKvkEK5lU5Kn7HpU3sxPwqiB.jpg","language":"it","width":1143,"height":1714}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tRLvA1kqbII1IuFDaRncQUkDLqW.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tRLvA1kqbII1IuFDaRncQUkDLqW.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tRLvA1kqbII1IuFDaRncQUkDLqW.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tRLvA1kqbII1IuFDaRncQUkDLqW.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tm